                                                "sense_id": "1c3bea8e-8596-3520-a587-bd94c43e9241",
                                                "text": "It was a long, difficult business, for the coins were of all countries and sizes — doubloons, and louis d’ors, and guineas, and pieces of eight, and I know not what besides, all shaken together at random."
                                            }
                                        ]
